# ── Hygiene: local agent / l10n-sweep scratch output (D10) ────────────────
# Catch-all for the *.txt / *.json scratch output the l10n-sweep and
# golden-fix loops leave in this directory (debug.py,
# find_missing_keys.py, group_failures.py, test_v*.txt,
# test_pre_commit.txt, etc.).
*.txt
*.json
debug.py
find_missing_keys.py
group_failures.py
